  "stem": "Two cars P and Q start from a point at the same time in a straight line and their positions are represented by $x_{P} = at + bt^{2}$ and $x_{Q} = ft - t^{2}$. At what time do the cars have the same velocity?",
  "options": {
    "A": "$\\frac{a + f}{2(1 + b)}$",
    "B": "$\\frac{f - a}{2(1 + b)}$",
    "C": "$\\frac{a - f}{(1 + b)}$",
    "D": "$\\frac{a + f}{2(b - 1)}$"
  },
  "answer": {
    "keys": [
      "B"
    ]
  },
